Error [jet.PositionalArgumentCount]: `positional` expects 2 arguments (name, help), got 1
  --> tests/ui/args_spec_bad_positional_arity.jet:7:23
    |
  7 |     spec: args.spec().positional("input")
    |                       ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `ArgsSpec.positional(name, help)` registers a required positional argument
 Fix: Pass exactly two strings: the positional name and a help description
